  "settings.r2BoundB": { "zh-CN": "。Endpoint / Region / 桶名这些都由 binding 决定，所以不再显示。", "zh-TW": "。Endpoint / Region / 桶名這些都由 binding 決定，所以不再顯示。", en: ". Endpoint, region and bucket all come from the binding, so they are hidden.", fr: ". Endpoint, région et bucket viennent de la liaison, ils sont donc masqués." },
